  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Finance Sustainable Investments and Improve Productivity in the Dominican Republics Agriculture Sector</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Financiacin de Inversiones Sostenibles y Mejora de la Productividad en el Sector Agrcola de Repblica Dominicana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es promover inversiones en tecnologas climticas de adaptacin y mitigacin, y tecnologas complementarias que contribuyan a mejorar la sostenibilidad de la produccin del sector agropecuario dominicano. El objetivo especfico de desarrollo del programa es el incremento en la provisin de crdito para la inversin y adopcin de tecnologas climticas y tecnologas complementarias de micro, pequeos y medianos productores agropecuarios.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to promote investments in climate adaptation and mitigation technologies, and complementary technologies that contribute to improving the sustainability of production in the Dominican agricultural sector. The specific development objective of the program is to increase the provision of credit for the investment and adoption of climate technologies and complementary technologies for micro, small and medium-sized agricultural producers.</narrative>
  </description>
